<% set_page_title("Cookies") %>

<h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">Cookies on GOV.UH Forms</h1>

<p class="govuk-body">
  GOV.UH Forms does not currently use optional analytics cookies on this product website.
</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-l">Essential cookies</h2>

<p class="govuk-body">
  The Forms editor and sign-in services may use essential cookies where they are necessary to authenticate an authorised user, protect a session or provide a requested service.
</p>

<p class="govuk-body">
  Essential cookies are not used for advertising.
</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-l">Changes to cookies</h2>

<p class="govuk-body">
  This page will be updated before optional analytics or other non-essential cookies are enabled on the GOV.UH Forms product website.
</p>
